Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:54:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Bump Go deps to fix CVEs

- go 1.25.0 -> 1.26.0
- golang.org/x/crypto v0.54.0 -> v0.58.0 (CVE-2026-56854)
- golang.org/x/net v0.57.0 -> v0.62.0 (CVE-2026-78669)
- golang.org/x/text v0.40.0 -> v0.43.0 (CVE-2026-56851)
- golang.org/x/sys v0.49.0, x/oauth2 v0.37.0, x/sync v0.24.0,
  x/time v0.16.0
---
 go.mod | 16 ++++++++--------
 go.sum | 28 ++++++++++++++--------------
 2 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

diff --git a/go.mod b/go.mod
index bd7983b..a83505d 100644
--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
